  "releaseNotes": "V3.2.1: Fixed IAsyncRelayCommand PropertyChanged event edge cases. ViewModelBase and ValidatorViewModelBase now implement IDisposable for automatic cleanup. Refactored samples to shared library. Added MvvmButton, Bootstrap components, and ConditionalSwitch. Enhanced RelayCommand examples.",
